  "text": "The model favours a pass to Mbappé, but shooting was still a defensible choice. After allowing for the risk of the pass failing, that option offered a modelled 28% chance of scoring, compared with 19% for Kolo Muani’s shot. [[ev:sb:3869685:4337]]\n\nThe catch is that the pass had only a 49% chance of reaching Mbappé. The comparison also assumes a clean reception and an immediate finish, while defenders could react. So passing looks better in the model, not like a guaranteed goal Kolo Muani threw away. [[ev:sb:3869685:4337]]",
